@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Local optional coupled DiffDrive profile
+Preserves the earlier post-SG finite/box correction and legacy disabled behavior.
+DiffDriveConstraints adds static wheel geometry/cap. Predict noisy samples and
+constrain final sequences with the shared convex-progress primitive. Normalize
+only future model anchors for out-of-range speed feedback; do not alter ROS
+measurements. The coupled profile consumes sample zero and shifts warm starts
+after emission, so history and the emitted first predicted rate step agree.
